WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.476
Teacher midterm practice, question 32.

2
00:00:04.096 --> 00:00:08.337
True or false: electron microscopes probe microstructures with

3
00:00:08.337 --> 00:00:12.770
greater resolution and magnification than optical microscopes.

4
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.716
Resolution is limited by wavelength, and electron beams

5
00:00:17.716 --> 00:00:20.741
have far shorter wavelengths than visible light.

6
00:00:21.361 --> 00:00:25.101
An optical microscope reaches about two thousand times.

7
00:00:25.101 --> 00:00:29.445
A transmission electron microscope reaches about a million times.

8
00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:32.761
So the answer is A: true.

9
00:00:33.581 --> 00:00:35.533
Remember the reason: the shorter the

10
00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:38.461
wavelength, the finer the detail you can resolve.
